<title>UK: Senior buys Nitrotec from LucasVarity.</title>
<headline>Senior buys Nitrotec from LucasVarity.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Senior Engineering Group Plc  said on Tuesday that it has bought Nitrotec Services from LucasVarity Plc for around three million stg in cash.</p>
<p>Nitrotec provides a range of heat treatment processes that improve the strength, durability and corrosion resistance of metal components.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
